Description:
AI4Bharat's IndicTrans2 (distilled, 200M parameters) translates call
captions between Hindi, Tamil, Bengali and English on the device (D4).
Tark uses the Indian-to-English and English-to-Indian checkpoints'
weights, SentencePiece model and vocabularies.

Local Modifications:
Rebuilt in plain PyTorch and exported to ONNX (an encoder and a cached
decoder step) with int8 weights by utils/indictrans_export.py; no change to
the model's behaviour beyond int8 rounding.
